nication). Reliability not explicit but leadership suggests.\n\nWhich candidate has least severe weaknesses? B's nasty remarks is serious for crew cooperation. C's egocentric and communication difficulty also serious. D's hot temper also serious. A's show-off and not open to new ideas also problematic but maybe less severe? Show-off could affect crew morale, not open to new ideas affects adaptability. But A has strong leadership and anticipation.\n\nThus maybe A is best overall despite some concerns. Let's propose recommendation for Candidate A, but we need to justify with facts.\n\nWe can say: Based on anticipation of dangerous situations (decision quality), ability to see complex connections (technical competence), excellent spatial vision (operational skill), and very good leadership (crew cooperation), A stands out. The concerns (show-off, not open to new ideas) are noted but may be mitigated with training, and they are less critical than the communication issues of B, C, D.\n\nThus vote for Candidate A.\n\nWe need to output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate A\"."}
